 "remarks": "Select units at Coastal Point, a boutique collection of just 12 condos built in 2017 in central Westport, are now being offered for sale for the very first time. Residence 401, one of three two-bedroom townhouses in the complex with 1,660 sq.ft. of thoughtfully designed living space. Built by Westport's preeminent builder, Coastal Luxury Homes, to the standards of a luxury single-family home, it showcases clean architectural lines, abundant natural light, hardwood floors, solid wood doors and custom millwork throughout. The kitchen features high end appliances, and the townhome layout offers the space and separation of a house with none of the upkeep. In-unit laundry, air conditioning and private indoor parking add everyday ease. With stunning exterior finishes and a private patio, the residences are surrounded by beautifully landscaped grounds, with shops, restaurants and services within walking distance, and downtown Westport, the train and Long Island Sound beaches a short drive away. A rare opportunity to own new, low-maintenance luxury townhome in one of Westport's most convenient locations.",
